---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Yoga | Amitoj Singh" description="Yoga practice and offerings. Where movement meets contemplative wisdom.">
  <!-- Hero Photo -->
  <section class="container-zen pt-12 pb-8">
    <div class="max-w-3xl">
      <img
        src="/images/photography-optimized/DSCF1773.webp"
        alt="Delicate branch with soft bokeh background"
        class="w-full h-72 object-cover"
        style="object-position: center 55%;"
      />
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-zen section-zen pt-8">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h1 class="mb-8 text-balance">Yoga</h1>

      <div class="accent-line mb-8"></div>

      <p class="text-lg text-ink-light mb-6">
        Yoga is how I study the same questions I research — attention, effort, release — through the body instead of the literature.
      </p>

      <p class="text-ink-light">
        I've practiced for over a decade. What began as physical exercise became a laboratory for understanding attention.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-zen section-zen border-t border-oat-300">
    <h2 class="text-2xl mb-8 section-header">Practice</h2>

    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="text-ink-light mb-6">
        Vinyasa tradition, emphasis on alignment and breath. Yoga Alliance RYT.
      </p>

      <p class="text-ink-light">
        Physical practice supports cognitive and emotional clarity by training the nervous system to move between states with intention. The body knows things the mind doesn't.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-zen section-zen border-t border-oat-300">
    <h2 class="text-2xl mb-8 section-header">Offerings</h2>

    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="text-ink-light mb-4">
        Private sessions, group classes, and workshops. I also bring contemplative practice into organizational settings for teams navigating transformation or building resilience together.
      </p>
      <p class="text-ink-muted text-sm">
        Contact for details.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-zen section-zen border-t border-oat-300">
    <h2 class="text-2xl mb-8 section-header">Third Enlightenment Connection</h2>

    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <p class="text-ink-light mb-6">
        The connection between contemplative practice and the <a href="/third-enlightenment" class="text-sage-700 hover:text-sage-900 underline">Third Enlightenment framework</a> is spelled out on its own page. The short version: AI handles cognitive labor; what remains is the kind of knowing that comes through the body. Yoga trains that.
      </p>

      <a href="/third-enlightenment" class="arrow-link">Read the full framework</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="container-zen section-zen border-t border-oat-300 bg-oat-100">
    <div class="max-w-2xl">
      <h2 class="text-2xl mb-6">Begin</h2>

      <p class="text-ink-light mb-8">
        If you're in Boston and want to practice, get in touch.
      </p>

      <a href="/contact" class="arrow-link">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
